# Rover Pay (rovershop-storefront#173): the Dockerfile copies the whole monorepo
# into its prune stage, so anything here must never reach a build layer.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/.vercel
.git
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
